# CODEOWNERS — auto-requests the right reviewer based on what a PR touches.
# In a solo portfolio repo every path points at you; the value is showing that
# review routing scales with blast radius. In a real org, the high-risk paths
# below would point at senior engineers or a platform team, not the default owner.
#
# Replace @lewisca before pushing.

# Default owner for everything.
*                       @lewisca

# High blast radius — schema and data access. Always an owner review.
/migrations/            @lewisca
/src/db.js              @lewisca

# Pipeline and agent configuration — changes here change the guardrails themselves.
/.github/               @lewisca
/.claude/               @lewisca
/CODEOWNERS             @lewisca
